OL,3,GNEWSAAirport running costs 'jump from
OL,4,A#5m to #10m'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaxpayers are paying almost #10m a year
OL,7,Fon airport running costs, a council
OL,8,Fmeeting has heard.
OL,10,FCornwall Council, which owns Newquay
OL,11,FAirport, met on Wednesday to discuss
OL,12,Fhow the loss-making facility could be
OL,13,Foperated more efficiently. The Steer
OL,14,Freport included 71 recommendations for
OL,15,Fchange.
OL,17,FIndependent councillor Andrew Mitchell
OL,18,Fsaid: "We have overnight, it appears to
OL,19,Fme, required to jump from a #5m a year
OL,20,Fsubsidy to #10m a year."
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
