OL,3,GNEWSAAirport running costs 'jump from
OL,4,A#5m to #10m'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Cooper, Corserv's director of
OL,7,Fresources, said a big increase was due
OL,8,Fto the employers' National Insurance
OL,9,Fuplift, which caused a #3.5m "hit" to
OL,10,FCorserv, including the airport. The
OL,11,Fcouncil agreed its corporate finance
OL,12,Fscrutiny committee should analyse the
OL,13,Fincrease.
